  "proven": [
    "A child Node worker with its own DataSource claims a durable command; HTTP suspension cancels it before invocation, with zero provider POSTs.",
    "API/worker restart preserves cancellation. Self-approval is denied; current distinct owner approval and disposition allow resume.",
    "One freshly admitted command yields exactly one controlled HTTP POST and durable confirmation; repeat resume and restart yield no new POST.",
    "Validation, immutable probe request, audit and receipt commit together; forced audit failure rolls everything back.",
    "Registered development worker factory calls a bounded controlled HTTP observer. Expired lease recovery by competing workers publishes one result set.",
    "Repeat/restart does not duplicate requested probes; negative provider observations remain negative; revoked initiator stops provider reads.",
    "Core 0200 has scoped report FK and immutable request/terminal records; fresh/upgrade/down/up/failed migration recovery pass on both database versions."
  ],
